---
source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "subcommand_help(\"uninstall\")"
---
Stop local dreamd servers, unregister this project, and clear caches

Usage: uninstall [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --keep-caches
          Keep the native binary cache (~/.cache/dreamd-mcp) and npx cache entries

      --all-npx
          Wipe the ENTIRE npx cache (every cached package, not just dreamd-mcp). Prints a warning before deleting

  -q, --quiet
          Suppress non-essential output (errors still print to stderr)

  -h, --help
          Print help
